{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Time\u00a0to Strike it Rich!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raccoons to Riches</strong> is a small solo-developed\u00a0<strong>Roguelike Deck Builder </strong>about running an item shop where you play as an industrious raccoon! Rake in huge profits while you expand your shop and craft your market strategy to supply both townsfolk and adventurers alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wheel and Deal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/c17224d0ed8cb9f0b955145a295d1cba.poster.avif?t=1774454937\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/c17224d0ed8cb9f0b955145a295d1cba.webm?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/c17224d0ed8cb9f0b955145a295d1cba.mp4?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't your average Roguelike Deckbuilder! Instead of fighting monsters, you'll be <strong>Selling Items</strong>\u00a0and playing<strong>\u00a0Business Tactics and Mottos</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0convince your Customers to pay piles of <strong>Gold</strong> for your wares. If you can match your Items' types with your Customers' Preferences, you'll really <strong>supercharge your profits</strong>!\u00a0You'll need to be quick though! After customers run out of<strong> Patience,</strong>\u00a0they'll make room for the next customer in line. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Spend your time wisely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/515de91509a00bdffd9859d06664067f.poster.avif?t=1774454937\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/515de91509a00bdffd9859d06664067f.webm?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/515de91509a00bdffd9859d06664067f.mp4?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you spend your days is up to you! <strong>Carefully balance</strong> opening up your shop for business, resupplying at the <strong>Supply Shoppe</strong>, and taking some well earned days off to experience various <strong>Events</strong>. If you can survive a whole month in business while keeping up with your weekly payments, you'll <strong>prove you've got what it takes</strong> to be the ultimate shopkeeper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Synergistic Shop Decorations\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/4e18409c045a2229a8df17c31e9d5dfc.poster.avif?t=1774454937\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/4e18409c045a2229a8df17c31e9d5dfc.webm?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/4e18409c045a2229a8df17c31e9d5dfc.mp4?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your shop with powerful<strong>\u00a0Decoration cards</strong>\u00a0that all have their own abilities you can craft a synergistic strategy around. Between your <strong>Shelves</strong>, <strong>Carpet</strong>, <strong>Lighting</strong>, <strong>Workbench</strong>, and <strong>Sales Counter</strong>\u00a0slots, you can create exciting builds that can really amp up your profits! They can grant free item enhancements, customer alterations, extra card draw, and more when they're triggered by your savvy business dealings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hone your Daily Inventory</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/b1acb5a6690e273a48960f8893e935e9.poster.avif?t=1774454937\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/b1acb5a6690e273a48960f8893e935e9.webm?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/b1acb5a6690e273a48960f8893e935e9.mp4?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your shop's Daily Inventory with<strong> Items</strong> that your Customers will love. <strong>Food</strong>, <strong>Potions</strong>, <strong>Armour</strong> and <strong>Weapons</strong> can all be especially valuable to the right buyer! Focus on one or two types to specialize, or go for all 4 for a more general-store that's ready for anyone. <br><br>Learn awesome<strong> Business Tactics and Mottos</strong>\u00a0that can convince your customers to change their preferences, help you craft new items, or maybe find just the thing you need to make a big sale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shoppe Till You Droppe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/ee023afba86cd42482d2e48c280b85fe.poster.avif?t=1774454937\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/ee023afba86cd42482d2e48c280b85fe.webm?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/ee023afba86cd42482d2e48c280b85fe.mp4?t=1774454937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resupply your shop's Inventory at the<strong> Supply Shoppe</strong>, where you can pick up some wholesale items, learn new business tactics, grab some new decorations, upgrade your line size with a new permit, and even advertise your shop to new types of customers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd9d 3 (and a half) different playable Raccoon Shopkeepers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad 30 interesting and weird Customers to add to your Customer Base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 21 Different Items to sell, buy, craft, and rummage away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 76 Business Tactics/Mottos to exploit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude91 151 Decorations to customize your shop with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2757 32 Quests to unlock some of the above with, ranging from simple to quite difficult\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small solo-developed game, but if you're looking for a unique profit-driven twist on the usual Roguelike Deckbuilding formula, or you're a fan of tycoon and item shop simulators, you'll probably have a good time with this!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778620?t=1774454937","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/01f58e577e6e030b99218a7ade2bf82369f08e22/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774454937","capsule_image":"ht